{"about_the_game":"In a world where living disasters have eradicated people\u2019s homes, the protagonist sets out on a journey with Hounimal, the village guardian, to restore homes to the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect and Place Furniture</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/hounimal_housing.gif?t=1744889346\" /><br>Obtain various pieces of furniture during your journey and place them in Hounimal. The actions you can choose in battle will change depending on the furniture. (Of course, you can also enjoy them as interior decorations!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simultaneous Turn-Based Command Battles</h2> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/extras/hounimal_battle.gif?t=1744889346\" /><br>Command battles progress simultaneously with the enemy! Skillfully coordinate the protagonist and Hounimal, who randomly assist, to control the order of actions and gain an advantage in battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rebuild Your Base</h2>Listen to your companions' requests to unlock features that make your journey easier. Draw out more of Hounimal's power.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3185010?t=1744889346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3185010?t=1744889346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/f91157d71c4d96b51bbb2005d86b1e70188f58dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744889346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185010/f91157d71c4d96b51bbb2005d86b1e70188f58dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744889346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In a world where living disasters have eradicated people\u2019s homes, the protagonist sets o